                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hello,\nFirst of all, thank you for giving my game a chance. Secondly, you may be able to solve the fullscreen issue by right-clicking on the window and going to properties. You will be able to select an option to start in fullscreen.\nAs for the crashes, I'm not sure what's causing this issue. I have tested the game and have never experienced a crash, but will see if the problem is indeed on my end and an update will be released shortly.\nThanks again,\nR",
